# Sampled Frame.io data. Live production content — slate and scene descriptions, character names,
# crew emails — and frameio-sample.json additionally holds signed media download URLs. The scripts
# that produce it are committed; the data is not. See docs/frameio/README.md to regenerate.
docs/frameio/data/

# types/ is deliberately committed, matching omc-util. This package is consumed as a git
# dependency by a Docker build with no credentials; shipping the built .d.ts files means npm
# never has to install TypeScript and run `tsc` inside the image to satisfy a `prepare` script.
